{"beat": 7, "name": "THE HONEST LIMIT", "text": "What you can't do by hand is that last step at any real scale. Running a year of a 24-product catalog 2,000 times, with demand that moves together across products the way it really does, is a model, and a bad model is worse than no model. What you can do today is stop asking winners how they won. Ask how many people ran their plan, and where the rest of them are. You can build this yourself. If you're doing real volume and want it run with rigor, this is what I do, and I only get paid when it works.", "provider": "library", "words": [{"word": "What", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.186}, {"word": "you", "start": 0.221, "end": 0.29}, {"word": "can't", "start": 0.36, "end": 0.58}, {"word": "do", "start": 0.615, "end": 0.697}, {"word": "by", "start": 0.766, "end": 0.871}, {"word": "hand", "start": 0.952, "end": 1.265}, {"word": "is", "start": 1.509, "end": 1.66}, {"word": "that", "start": 1.707, "end": 1.846}, {"word": "last", "start": 1.927, "end": 2.194}, {"word": "step", "start": 2.229, "end": 2.519}, {"word": "at", "start": 2.763, "end": 2.972}, {"word": "any", "start": 3.042, "end": 3.262}, {"word": "real", "start": 3.355, "end": 3.599}, {"word": "scale.", "start": 3.669, "end": 4.226}, {"word": "Running", "start": 5.039, "end": 5.329}, {"word": "a", "start": 5.375, "end": 5.399}, {"word": "year", "start": 5.457, "end": 5.712}, {"word": "of", "start": 5.805, "end": 5.909}, {"word": "a", "start": 5.979, "end": 6.014}, {"word": "24-product", "start": 6.142, "end": 6.896}, {"word": "catalog", "start": 6.931, "end": 7.523}, {"word": "2,000", "start": 7.639, "end": 8.197}, {"word": "times,", "start": 8.243, "end": 8.754}, {"word": "with", "start": 8.87, "end": 9.044}, {"word": "demand", "start": 9.091, "end": 9.404}, {"word": "that", "start": 9.451, "end": 9.578}, {"word": "moves", "start": 9.636, "end": 9.938}, {"word": "together", "start": 9.985, "end": 10.507}, {"word": "across", "start": 10.832, "end": 11.331}, {"word": "prod